  - capstone
abstract: "Finscope is the integrating capstone of a ten-repository research portfolio: a modular workbench that runs an end-to-end financial-research cycle on real public data (Yahoo Finance, FRED) — ingestion, diagnostic analytics, a rolling-origin inflation-forecasting study with Diebold-Mariano comparison, walk-forward portfolio construction net of costs, VaR/ES risk reporting, and an evidence-first research brief that documents epistemic limits at every stage. A research workbench for evaluating methods, not a trading system."
